Top-down layering of airflow.here's Capability Materialization: the planted CBM pointer leaf (cbmProc.spcs) at the top points to (does not duplicate) the CBS (airflow-cbs.pcs), which declares the bundle of sbom, the 4 airflow-*-sysd.pcs units, and the assemble step. airflowAdmin.cs sits below all of that as the day-to-day admin-facing CS an operator runs against the materialized installation.
